{"page":30,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:191","surah":2,"ayah":191,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱقْتُلُوهُمْ حَيْثُ ثَقِفْتُمُوهُمْ وَأَخْرِجُوهُم مِّنْ حَيْثُ أَخْرَجُوكُمْ ۚ وَٱلْفِتْنَةُ أَشَدُّ مِنَ ٱلْقَتْلِ ۚ وَلَا تُقَـٰتِلُوهُمْ عِندَ ٱلْمَسْجِدِ ٱلْحَرَامِ حَتَّىٰ يُقَـٰتِلُوكُمْ فِيهِ ۖ فَإِن قَـٰتَلُوكُمْ فَٱقْتُلُوهُمْ ۗ كَذَٰلِكَ جَزَآءُ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Kill them wherever you encounter them, and drive them out from where they drove you out, for persecution is more serious than killing. Do not fight them at the Sacred Mosque unless they fight you there. If they do fight you, kill them- this is what such disbelievers deserve-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱقْتُلُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"And kill them","transliteration":"wa-uq'tulūhum","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"wherever","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ثَقِفْتُمُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"you find them","transliteration":"thaqif'tumūhum","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأَخْرِجُوهُم","en_gloss":"and drive them out","transliteration":"wa-akhrijūhum","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":6,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"wherever","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَخْرَجُوكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"they drove you out","transliteration":"akhrajūkum","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلْفِتْنَةُ","en_gloss":"and [the] oppression","transliteration":"wal-fit'natu","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَشَدُّ","en_gloss":"(is) worse","transliteration":"ashaddu","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"than","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْقَتْلِ ۚ","en_gloss":"[the] killing","transliteration":"l-qatli","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:191"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تُقَـٰتِلُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"fight them","transliteration":"tuqātilūhum","verse_ke